      ],
      "source": "https://www.lakeshastina.org/history-of-lake-shastina",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The reservoir’s filling was delayed by geological faults and the driest three years on record for Siskiyou County.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        25,
        28
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.lakeshastinacsd.gov/history-of-lake-shastina",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Dr. Dwinnell envisioned a gravity‑fed water system delivering up to 60,000 acre‑feet from the Shasta River and Parks Creek.",
